# Foxdroid
*****************

Foxdroid is an UNOFFICIAL fork of CyanogenMod 9.1.0 designed to introduce fixes and major changes to the system itself;
Changelog documenting system changes;

*****************

## 1.0 (Pancake)
### 2026.07.06 - 2026.07.12
* "Nyandroid" easter-egg has been fixed so that droids fit on smaller resolutions;
* Many pre-installed apps from CM have been removed;
* Changes to Settings.apk > Modifying the About Phone/Tablet screen;
* The boot screen has been changed;